      "body": "paging dsl text looks great. this part is approved. however, perf is now too blown up. it took 30 minutes to render a 12 second 8x8 grid DSL tutorial. We should dig into the blow up now. I imagine switching ALL text we are able to to SVG will help. And the big heavy part as you mentioned is CANVAS. we need to identify is there is an easier method, or if this is an unavoidable cost (some templates are heavy and its ok if they are visually polished enough). I suspect there is much optmization we may do.",
